            "review_title": "Review at The Publik House",
            "review_text": "rpisces11\nDa Nang, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nWouldnt give us two slices of baguette\nMar 2018 • Friends\nShares the same space with Winking Seal. Your typical craft beer hangout. The meatball dish was satisfactory, but the waitress cringed when asked for two more slices of baguette. Are you serious...\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 27, 2018\nCalvin B\nDear rpisces11,\n\nMy apologies for the #BreadGate debacle. Instead of wincing at you, our staff \"should've\" obliged to your simple request of additional bread. I take full responsibility for this and I'm sorry. \n\nWhat would you say we use this as a learning lesson for our team and allow us to offer you a flight of beers and an order of our famous gochujang chicken wings. \n\nAll on the house of course :)\n\nEmail me (calvin) @ publikhousesaigon@gmail and we will make this wrong a right!\nRead more\nWritten March 29, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
