            "review_title": "Review at The Publik House",
            "review_text": "DeAndra B\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nThe energy, THE FOOD, THE WINGS, the beer!\nMar 2018 • Friends\nMeatball 5 stars-It was sultry and comforting all at the same time. Well rounded seasoning with the perfect kick from the chili flakes at the end. Personally reminded me of my mom's cooking. The sauce was so delicious. A warm hug. I would definitely devour again.\nKorean Wings-Yes I got to sample one. And BOOM. These are good! Exciting flavor-perfect balance of savory and sweet-and the perfect amount of sesame to finish. These saucy bi**hes still have the right crunch on the skin. Which so important in KFC. I love these too!! I would come to back so I can have my own plate and get down, get dirty.\nChicharrones-These are authentic!! Yummy and crunchy. My only feedback would be maybe less paprika, so you can taste the chili more.\n\nAnd the IPA goes down smooth! Highly enjoyable cannot wait to go back for the wings.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 23, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
