            "review_title": "Review at The Publik House",
            "review_text": "Brandon E\n11 contributions\n0\nCreative small plates, craft beer, and fun atmosphere\nFeb 2018 • Friends\nGreat spot for a date or fun night with friends. The food is sharable, the atmosphere is social, the beer is fantastic. It's definitely a spot for foodies as the food is inventive and original. Especially enjoyed the giant meatball, the grilled sea bass, and the cheese plate. Also, if its open and not too hot, I recommend sitting on the rooftop for its wonderful atmosphere. Super happy to have a place like this in Saigon!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 5, 2018",
