            "review_text": "KimAnh N\n6 contributions\n0\nSimply put, I’m obsessed\nFeb 2018 • Friends\nAfter coming here the first time, I came back twice within the same week - it’s that good!! I’ve been missing home and this place brought me a strong sense of familiarity with its food, ambience of the restaurant, and the friendliness of the staff. \n\nThe cheeseboard has a great variety that I’ve been craving and topping the cheeses with the chutney is an excellent combination of smooth, sweet, and tangy - I’ve ordered it every time I’ve gone back! The polenta cake with pork shoulder screamed wine-braised-tender, robust, and savory. This dish took me awhile to eat because the flavor of each bite was enthralling! And lastly, the caramelized onion and cream puff pastry sticks... perfectly crispy and creamy. \n\nYou cannot go wrong with any of the food in this place, along with the amazing beer from Winking Seal (which you can order with the food). It’s a perfect place to go with your friends or even with a date as the restaurant setting is both open AND intimate! \n\nCome once and you’ll definitely be coming back like me!\nRead more\nWritten March 4, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
