            "review_text": "Max K\n3 contributions\n0\nCraft Beers, Inventive Small Plates and ATMOSPHERE\nFeb 2018 • Friends\nWe had an amazing meal at The Publik House.\n\nOur group was 8 people so we decided to order everything on the menu and share.\n\nWe had;\nMarinated mixed olives\nChicharones\nFish sauce caramel nuts\nCharcuterie\nCheese board\nCaramelized onion and cheese puff pastry sticks\nLotus seed falafel\nGochujang Chicken Wings\nMeatball\nBacon Carbonara\nSea bass\nPork Shoulder\nNew York Baked cheese cake\nChurros\n\nALL I CAN SAY IS AMAZING!!!\n\nGreat selection of beers from winking seal beer co.\n\nMekong Mashup\nOne Eye IPA\nCream Ale\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 4, 2018",
