            "review_title": "Review at The Publik House",
            "review_text": "Sue J\nLake Mary, Florida10 contributions\n0\nFantastic food at a reasonable price!\nMar 2018 • Friends\nMy friends and I had a great time sampling several menu items at the soft opening: cheese board, meatball, sea bass, bacon carbonara, cheesecake, and churros. The meatball was so good, I giggled. I can't even give a higher compliment. The pork shoulder dish was braised perfectly and complemented so nicely by the crispy black pudding and tasty polenta. The sea bass was also standout, crispy-edged and sat atop super yummy eggplant caponata. The food is great, pairs really well with the Winking Seal craft beer selection, and the price points are reasonable. We already returned once and everything was just as good.\nRead more\nWritten March 4, 2018",
